                "kind": "text",
                "text": " returns a bounded, zero-filled strip of daily photo counts. Both facts were already in the database and read by nothing, so this is a read path and not a new collection: no migration, no new write, and nothing about a person that was not already recorded. The blobs stay end to end encrypted and no endpoint added here exposes any diary content."
