                "text": " and all three transports (pigeon, SMTP, console), the email-verification and auth-reset token kinds, and the reset-link plumbing. The mailed reset was an account-takeover path that returned no recovery: the DEK is wrapped under keys the server never sees, so whoever redeemed a link got a login to a diary they still could not read."
